{"results": [{"id": "hp_doc_858901fb632a4140e56fba4e8a1632196c725678ad71edbebac889143c7d92e6", "title": "Your Own Little Corner of My Heart", "text": "\"Your Own Little Corner of My Heart\" is a song recorded by American country music group Blackhawk. It was released in February 1999 as the second single from the album \"The Sky's the Limit\". the song reached #27 on the \"Billboard\" Hot Country Singles & Tracks chart. The song was written by Walt Aldridge and Brad Crisler.", "score": 47.3529}, {"id": "hp_doc_45b082491778b292871e0e9b1ebb0f04aac60397bed113ea0b330fb1b023a709", "title": "The Sky's the Limit (Blackhawk album)", "text": "The Sky's the Limit is the fourth studio album released by American country music band BlackHawk. Their final studio album for Arista Nashville, it features the singles \"There You Have It\" and \"Your Own Little Corner of My Heart\", which respectively reached #4 and #27 on the Hot Country Songs charts. \"There You Have It\" was also a number 41 on the \"Billboard\" Hot 100.", "score": 33.3573}, {"id": "hp_doc_04cb1ec5c5de739d95f5a247678e0e8d25634d9dad62befd51c864fbc6f1d892", "title": "My Little Corner of the World", "text": "\"My Little Corner of the World\" (sometimes recorded as \"In My Little Corner of the World\") is a 1960 love song with music written by Lee Pockriss and lyrics by Bob Hilliard. \\", "score": 30.8944}], "remaining_searches": 2}
